# 8️⃣ GitHub Actions Workflow (FULL CI/CD)

### `.github/workflows/jfrog-ci-cd.yml`

```yaml
name: Spring Boot CI/CD - JFrog

on:
  push:
    branches: [ "main" ]

jobs:
  build-and-push:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest

    steps:
      - name: Checkout source
        uses: actions/checkout@v4

      - name: Setup Java 17
        uses: actions/setup-java@v4
        with:
          distribution: 'temurin'
          java-version: '17'

      - name: Build JAR
        run: mvn clean package -DskipTests

      - name: Login to JFrog Artifactory
        run: |
          echo "${{ secrets.JFROG_TOKEN }}" | docker login \
          ${{ secrets.JFROG_URL }} \
          -u ${{ secrets.JFROG_USERNAME }} \
          --password-stdin

      - name: Build Docker Image
        run: |
          docker build -t \
          ${{ secrets.JFROG_URL }}/docker-local/springboot-jfrog-ci-cd:latest .

      - name: Push Docker Image
        run: |
          docker push \
          ${{ secrets.JFROG_URL }}/docker-local/springboot-jfrog-ci-cd:latest
```

